{ Your bishop pawn is ready to promote. Find a stalemate shelter after the queen check. } 1... Qb6+ { The queen checks. Can your king make capturing the pawn harmless? } 2. Ka8 { You leave the pawn. Taking it will leave your king without a legal move. [%cal Gb8a8] } (2. Kc8 { That loses. Your king blocks its own pawn instead of threatening stalemate. } 2... Kd5 3. Kd7 3... Qd6+ 4. Ke8 4... Qxc7 { Black wins your pawn. Without it, your king cannot hold against the queen. [%cal Rd6c7] }) 2... Qxc7 { Stalemate! Your king on a8 has no legal move and is not in check, so the game is drawn. [%csl Ga8] } 1-0


